--- .gitignore (原始)
```
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build outputs
out/

# Package lock file
package-lock.json

# Logs
*.log

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.swp

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Distribution / packaging
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.Python

# Compiled binary files
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Compressed archives
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.tar.xz
*.7z
*.rar

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
```
# Build outputs
out/
dist/
build/
*.js.map

# Dependencies
node_modules/
server/node_modules/

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp

# Environment
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Package lock files (already tracked in your repo, so ignoring just in case)
package-lock.json
server/package-lock.json
```